][*] ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:02:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043331","verified_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163770-1847286114032633","game_id":"steam-5163770","kind":"announcement","title":"Sponge Bridges Demo — Performance, Smoother Movement & Delivery Encounters","summary":"This update includes: Big performance improvement when many monsters are around. Smoother tile movement: much less of that \"invisible wall\" feeling, for you and for monsters. Stronger hit feedback: hit-stop, flinches, flashes and controller rumble. New delivery encounters: enemies, traps and acid puddles now show up along the route. Order cards get an \"Along the way\" line, and you get a short heads-up the first time you meet each kind. New bandit enemies who steal your cargo. They carry it on th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:22:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032633","verified_at":"2026-10-22T13:30:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163770-1846651706690190","game_id":"steam-5163770","kind":"update","title":"Weekly Development Update — Demo v0.1.3","summary":"Hi everyone, Another big week: over 600 commits went into the game, and the new Sponge Bridges Demo v0.1.3 brings most of it to you. Buildings 400 new building types: houses, shops, warehouses, garages and more Delivery New trap puzzles: 3 kinds of mechanisms (periodic spike plates, laser gates, pushable crates) New adventure events you may meet on delivery routes: 20 kinds Two new ways to complete the demo Sight and light Fog of war has a new look Loading and performance Loading was rebuilt in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:18:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690190","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163770-1846651706681416","game_id":"steam-5163770","kind":"announcement","title":"Sponge Bridges Demo — Twin-Stick Aiming & Small Improvements","summary":"This update includes: New twin-stick aiming: hold aim with a gun to move the crosshair freely while you keep walking. More realistic shooting: shotguns fire spreads of pellets, windows weaken bullets. Sleep lets you choose how long. New \"Wear\" action and \"Hold\" key setting. Read books get their own category; long item lists can be folded. Fixed shelf goods showing placeholder icons after loading a save. Thanks for playing and sharing your feedback! Website: http://spongebridges.com/ Kickstarter:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:09:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681416","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163770-1846018067940946","game_id":"steam-5163770","kind":"announcement","title":"Sponge Bridges Demo — Small Fixes & Improvements","summary":"This update includes: New water: lakes, rivers, oceans, shorelines and bridges. You can swim and dive. New forests. Improved line-of-sight fog. Added goats, reindeer and tigers. Lots of new icons. Thanks for playing and sharing your feedback! Website: http://spongebridges.com/ Kickstarter: https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/alungames/sponge-bridges-a-deep-survival-game-of-delivery?ref=267eh4","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T13:32:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067940946","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163770-1846018067938129","game_id":"steam-5163770","kind":"update","title":"Weekly Development Update — Demo v0.1.2","summary":"Hi everyone, This was a big week. Over 100 commits and more than 50,000 changed lines went into the game, and the new Sponge Bridges Demo v0.1.2 brings most of it to you. A world with more life and light New painted animals: cats, squirrels, rats, raccoons, crows, songbirds, hoofed animals and predators Decorative lights: ceiling lamps, bonfires and fireflies with real power states Fog of war Improved water opacity and sea colors Better muzzle and hit flashes A brand-new inventory New Compact Vi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T10:10:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938129","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163770-1845383656395629","game_id":"steam-5163770","kind":"announcement","title":"Sponge Bridges Demo — Small Fixes & Improvements","summary":"This update includes: Fixed issues with random seeds. Optimized game performance. Updated the theft and trading systems. Adjusted katana animations. Improved the dialogue system. Thanks for playing and sharing your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T08:26:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656395629","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163770-1845383656390487","game_id":"steam-5163770","kind":"update","title":"Weekly Development Update — Demo v0.1.1","summary":"Hi everyone, This week I finished the game’s sound system and added around 50% of the planned sound effects. These changes are already included in the newly released Sponge Bridges Demo v0.1.1. There is still more sound work to fill in, but the underlying system is now in place, which means the remaining effects can be added much faster from here. I’ll keep sharing a short development update every Sunday so you can follow the game’s progress week by week. Thanks for playing Sponge Bridges and fo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T04:21:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390487","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163770-1845383656388052","game_id":"steam-5163770","kind":"announcement","title":"Sponge Bridges is now on Kickstarter!","summary":"Sponge Bridges is now on Kickstarter! Kickstarter can give me more time to work on the game, but I also want it to become another way for players to take part in its development. Feedback, ideas, professions, appearances, stories, and custom NPCs can all help make the world of Sponge Bridges richer and more varied. If you'd like to support the project — or even leave a small part of yourself in the game — you can join the campaign here: Kickstarter: Support Sponge Bridges on Kickstarter Thank yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T00:09:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388052","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163770-1845383656382234","game_id":"steam-5163770","kind":"announcement","title":"Sponge Bridges Demo v0.1 is now available!","summary":"Sponge Bridges Demo v0.1 is now available! Welcome to the first public release. If you run into bugs or have any feedback, feel free to let me know in the Steam Community Discussions. Thanks for playing!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T16:52:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656382234","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5163770-1844751498233000","game_id":"steam-5163770","kind":"announcement","title":"Sponge Bridges Demo v0.1 — Coming October 1!","summary":"Hey everyone — I’m Alun, welcome to Sponge Bridges.The first public demo is almost here, and this is the first time I'm properly saying hello to all of you.Sponge Bridges Demo v0.1 is planned to launch on October 1, 2026.Yes, indeed.In a dangerous and lonely post-apocalyptic world.▸ Deliver cargo. ◈ Scavenge. ✦ Survive. ⚔ Fight.And one day, find a way to reconnect what was lost.This is just the beginning. I'll continue updating and improving the demo as we head into Steam Next Fest — October 202","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T02:54:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233000","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:33:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5163770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5163770":"2026-10-26T09:06:52Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5163770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:51Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:51Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:51Z"},"5299140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:52Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id"